<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-ANAM INDUSTRIAL H1/97 NET RISES.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ANAM INDUSTRIAL H1/97 NET RISES.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net				   11.09 vs   7.66</p>
<p>    Turnover			   598.28 vs 545.08</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		 14.49 vs  10.53</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries (both loss)    2.61 vs   1.22</p>
<p>NOTE - Anam Industrial Co is South Korea's leading semiconductor assembly company. It said its share capital rose by 8.9 million shares to 26.88 million during the 12-month period to June due to rights and bonus issues.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5646</p>
